@base = http://localhost:8080

### List events
GET {{base}}/api/events

### One event
GET {{base}}/api/events/1

### Seats for event 1
GET {{base}}/api/events/1/seats

### Book seats 1 and 2 (should succeed: 201)
POST {{base}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "eventId": 1, "seatIds": [1, 2] }

### Book seat 1 again (should fail: 409 Conflict)
POST {{base}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "eventId": 1, "seatIds": [1] }

### Get booking 1
GET {{base}}/api/bookings/1

### Unknown event (should be 404)
GET {{base}}/api/events/999
